WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.910
HouseCheck.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:05.350
Carfax for New York apartments, built in Rust.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:08.760
Before you sign a lease,

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:12.480
the information that says whether a building is maintained is already public.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.200
It's just spread across four agency websites.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:19.460
HouseCheck asks what matters to you, then puts it on one card.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:21.670
Type an address.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:25.690
Two hundred fifty Brooklyn buildings, served live.

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:31.560
A score out of a hundred, across condition,

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:34.980
legal protection, neighborhood and accessibility.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.920
Every number links back to the city dataset it came from.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:43.690
The violations are in the city's own words, with how long each has been open.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.550
Repair speed is the one measure of behavior, not just state.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.890
And you can take the record with you.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.750
The downloaded file is the verifiable one.

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:05.860
Here's that exact file.

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:09.080
I check it offline with HouseCheck's own verification code.

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:13.680
The hash chain recomputes, the Ed25519 signature is valid,

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:16.440
and the key matches the one published at slash meta.

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:17.740
Signed and intact.

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:22.880
Change one character in one violation, and it's caught, down to the row.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.000
But signing alone wasn't enough.

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:28.960
A forger can rewrite a row, rebuild the whole chain,

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:31.980
and sign it with their own key, and it still checks out as intact.

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:34.400
I found that hole while verifying it in production.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:39.330
That's why the signing key is published apart from the documents it signs.

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:42.690
Compare against it, and the forgery is exposed.

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:48.260
A hundred seventy-six tests, clippy clean, live.

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:52.180
Two hundred fifty buildings, about a tenth of a percent of the city.

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.420
It's a signal, not a legal ruling.
